%% draw-visual:
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant CLI as cli
  participant CMD as commands
  participant POL as policy
  participant PORT as port
  participant W as wait
  CLI->>CMD: decoded request
  Note over CLI,CMD: flags + config
  CMD->>PORT: getCatalog
  PORT-->>CMD: catalog, defaults
  CMD->>POL: resolve type
  POL-->>CMD: smallest fit
  CMD->>POL: check ceilings
  POL-->>CMD: ResolvedCreate
  Note over CMD,PORT: adapter encodes one payload
  alt dry-run
    CMD-->>CLI: redacted preview
    Note over CLI,CMD: no mutation
  else submit
    CMD->>PORT: createVm
    PORT-->>CMD: MutationReceipt
    opt --wait
      CMD->>W: poll, deadline
      W-->>CMD: completed
    end
    CMD-->>CLI: receipt
  end
